<p>The <strong class="selflink">lock_difficulty 2da</strong> defines the different difficulty levels for picking locks. In the Toolset these are listed in a placeable's <b>Pick Lock Level</b> property.
</p><p>The lock_difficulty 2da file is not listed in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da">M2DA_base 2da</a> and has not been assigned a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/TABLE" title="TABLE *">TABLE_*</a> constant.
</p>
